		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Slick Shoes</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — Leave a trail of grease that trips pursuers.</em></p><p><strong>Free Action.</strong> You leave grease in any spaces you enter this turn. Grease lasts 1 minute or until removed and is Slowed Terrain. Creatures that enter a greased space must succeed a DEX save or fall Prone.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Affects all spaces adjacent to you.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You ignore Slowed Terrain you create.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Posts the same DEX save (fail: Prone).</em></p><p><em>[M] Also grease every space adjacent to you.</em></p>",
